        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Shijiazhuang, Hunchun, Hebei Province, Beijing, North Hamgyong province, Primorsky Krai\n- People: Li Yanxi\n- Roles: capital, prefecture-level city, triple jumper\n\nFacts:\n- Shijiazhuang was formerly romanized as Shihkiachwang.\n- Shijiazhuang is the capital and largest city of Hebei Province in North China.\n- Shijiazhuang is a prefecture-level city about 263 km southwest of Beijing.\n- Shijiazhuang administers eight districts, two county-level cities, and 12 counties.\n- Hunchun borders North Korea's North Hamgyong province and Russia's Primorsky Krai.\n- Hunchun has over 250,000 inhabitants and covers 5,145 square kilometers.\n- Li Yanxi was born on June 26, 1984 in Shijiazhuang, Hebei.\n- Li Yanxi is a Chinese triple jumper.",
